                                                "sense_id": "40098b45-d82e-3fee-9d91-3c9200c0d9e7",
                                                "text": "Your care about your banks infers a fear\nOf threatening floods ,and inundations near;\nIf so, a just reprise would only be\nOf what the land usurped upon the sea"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
